{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "095188239f468db04116f46176d021ce9bbe2cd6005200e4c8f296fce8b09b8c", "ja": "何かって？", "zh": "是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_02_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "6c503e02a82a4345e71a05b4f2b2113238ee833385471f2b3bda624b2adaa7e0", "ja": "ウニャーッ！　それがわかったら苦労しないの！\nとにかく、何かが足りないのだよ、何かが……うぐぐ！", "zh": "呜喵——！要是知道是什么，就不用这么苦恼了！\n总之，就是缺了点什么，某种东西……唔唔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0273_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "7b3cb03c50fbea6628d3461feea25914c4ff0276091beef2fff34d4c48c1f5e3", "ja": "（うーん？　茜のこういうカンは、結構\n当たるからな……少し注意しておいた方がいいか）", "zh": "（嗯——？茜的这种直觉还挺准的……还是稍微注意一下比较好吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
